{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"bodyItems-wrapper\">    科技｜英偉達微軟深化協作 企業AI部署延伸至邊緣裝置           <p class=\"text text-block paragraph text-left tight-spacing neo-font-paragraph-xl-reg yf-18d6y07\" style=\"text-decoration: none; font-style: normal; text-transform: none; text-align: inherit; font-variant-numeric: normal;\">英偉達與微軟擴大合作，協助企業建立、自訂及部署智能應用程式。Azure數據中心已部署英偉達Vera Rubin NVL72，雙方並把機密運算推展至裸機及機架層級的AI基建。兩家公司亦擴充Microsoft Foundry服務及Nemotron 3.5系列模型，並把部署選擇延伸至雲端以外，涵蓋Azure Local、Jetson邊緣平台及Windows 365雲端電腦。GPU加速Windows 365的Direct Stream功能現接受限量預覽登記，計劃於2027年初推出公開預覽版。  </p> </div> </body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:44:01.038298+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":271,"images":0,"source":"Yahoo 科技","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T08:30:53+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:30.789745+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T10:37:30.789745+00:00","content_hash":"61433fe96ab37fc2f89b33d40a5d507022212e8ed436b21100b5e66ee0975e6e","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}